believe that what seems to us white, is black if the hierarchical Church so 
defines it."


ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:

  Winter gave way to sweet spring, and Supay prepared to carry out his 
urgent orders.  He prepared his armies to defend Paraguay and the 
surrounding provinces.

  Thus endeth the adventures of Supay for this year.


  Your Majesty, I have news to report of wanderers in our kingdom:  
  The 361st Legion experienced a disastrous raiding attempt in Peru and sank 
to Green quality.


  Here is the financial report for Supay's kingdom: this turn, the Kingdom 
collected 0 gold in revenue.  0 gold was expended to finance our leaders.  0 
gold was expended to maintain our armies.  Supay was left with 2 gold in the 
treasury.


